        "CopyrightInformation": "Crown Copyright © 2017. Published by Elsevier Ltd. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Obesity is a major health problem without satisfactory pharmacological treatment. A promising strategy is to promote energy dissipation by activating brown/beige adipose tissue. However, for this strategy to succeed it requires improving the transferability amongst cellular, murine, and human systems and bridging the gap between basic and clinical research."
